<title>USA: Avic Group CEO buys 25,000 restricted shrs.</title>
<headline>Avic Group CEO buys 25,000 restricted shrs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Avic Group International Inc said on Wednesday that Joseph Wright, its chairman and chief executive officer, acquired for cash 25,000 shares of restricted stock from the company on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The company said that this increases his Avic holdings to 297,500 shares and 3,000,000 options.</p>
